### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name" : "테스트",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "securePass123",
  "phone": "01012345678",
  "nickname": "test",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "birthDate": "2001-05-12"
}

