### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "securePass123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("token", "Bearer " + response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 회원정보 조회 - ID 기반
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/users/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### 회원정보 조회 - UUID 기반
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/users/uuid/b230e86d-50f5-455b-9742-28b81460e55e
Authorization: {{token}}

### 프로필 다운로드 API
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/users/1/profile/download

### 프로필 수정 API
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BOUNDARY123

--BOUNDARY123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profile"; filename="chicken.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /Users/minjiwon/Desktop/bappul/api/catalog/chicken.jpeg
--BOUNDARY123--

### 회원 주소 등록
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/address
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alias" : "집",
  "roadAddress" : "00시 000 000-0",
  "detailAddress" : "00동 00호",
  "zipcode" : "00000",
  "isDefault" :  true
}

### 회원 주소 조회
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/address
Authorization: {{token}}
